  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://puu.sh/AXSg7/5f2f78c06c.jpg\" alt=\"Logo header\" width=\"1000\" height=\"150\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">玩家分析是伺服器管理員監控玩家如何在伺服器上遊玩的終極工具。<br>內建的網路伺服器顯示有關伺服器的各個方面的見解，例如線上活動、玩家基礎以及這些隨時間的變化。</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Plan支援多種不同的平台和版本；Spigot, Paper, Sponge, SpongeForge, Bungeecord, Velocity, Cauldron, NukkitX 及所有衍生版本 - 以及 Fabric!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您需要在Fabric以外的平台上安裝Plan，請從 <a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github下載其他平台的Plan.jar</a> ，因為Curseforge上的jar只包含Fabric代碼</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代碼、API和文檔</a></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">錯誤、問題和建議</a></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/plan-player-analytics/projects/3\" rel=\"nofollow\">跟蹤開發</a></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/wiki/Bukkit-Configuration\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/wiki/Html-Customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定義</a></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"nofollow\">命令和許可權</a></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://puu.sh/FIcoW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"578\"></span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://puu.sh/vQyoA/1b703222c7.jpg\" alt=\"Screenshots\" width=\"1000\" height=\"100\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24460436/66251131-45280d80-e755-11e9-8b20-5b77ada795ff.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1078\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24460436/66251133-4f4a0c00-e755-11e9-9895-0693db610989.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1078\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24460436/66251862-8fad8800-e7d-11e9-9261-57c4c0103f1a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"637\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24460436/66251263-17dc5f00-e757-11e9-8ad6-7bac31168ce6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"661\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://puu.sh/HhMz3/a11ccfd4c9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"622\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS_Ti9zkoRc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://puu.sh/vQyoS/7b7b9a1414.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"100\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/wiki/Bukkit-Set-Up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">伺服器設定</a>&nbsp; </strong>|&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/wiki/Bungee-Set-Up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bungee設定</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在伺服器上設置Plan後，您應該考慮<a href=\"https://github.com/plan-player-analytics/Plan/wiki/SSL-Certificate-(HTTPS)-Set-Up\" rel=\"nofollow\">設置登錄 / HTTPS</a></span></strong></span></p>",
